{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48887","headline":"郢自街西醉归马鞭坠失崔员外起秘书知其阙用皆许见贻俄顷之间二信俱至短长坚重价不相饶辄抒短章仰酬珍锡 · 李郢","name":"郢自街西醉归马鞭坠失崔员外起秘书知其阙用皆许见贻俄顷之间二信俱至短长坚重价不相饶辄抒短章仰酬珍锡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蜀岩阴面冷冥冥，偃雪欺霜半露青。\n銛刃翦裁多鹊媚，细鞘挥拂带龙腥。\n崖垂万仞知无影，藓渍千年合有灵。\n兰省贵寮蓬阁吏，一时缄赠到云亭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48887.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48887","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}